# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# QUESTRA AI — FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your actual values.
# On Vercel, set these in Project → Settings → Environment Variables.

# Gemini AI API Key (required for AI question generation)
# Get from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
# Google OAuth Client ID (public — safe to expose)
# Get from: https://console.cloud.google.com/
VITE_REACT_APP_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=462752093792-7qe3v01bs6a25v8ldsttt9cenvg1mtg1.apps.googleusercontent.com

# Backend URL — use your Render service URL in production
VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://quesgen-ai-2.onrender.com
